sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Ambulância
  participant P as Patient Registry
  participant H as Pre-Hospital
  participant T as Telemetry
  participant K as Kafka
  participant C as Clinical Query
  participant N as Notification
  A->>P: identificar/criar Patient provisório
  A->>H: criar PreHospitalEncounter + ETA
  A->>T: abrir TelemetrySession
  loop telemetria
    A->>T: observação biométrica
    T-->>K: BiometricObservationReceived
    K-->>C: atualizar ClinicalPatientView
  end
  A->>H: atualizar risco/ETA
  H-->>K: PreArrivalAlertCreated
  K-->>N: avisar equipe da unidade
